502">い</span><span begin="00:33.502" end="00:33.755">無</span><span begin="00:33.755" end="00:33.857">い</span><span begin="00:33.857" end="00:33.957">無</span><span begin="00:33.957" end="00:34.109">い</span><span begin="00:34.109" end="00:34.259">無</span><span begin="00:34.259" end="00:34.361">い</span><span begin="00:34.361" end="00:34.513">無</span><span begin="00:34.513" end="00:34.615">い</span><span begin="00:34.615" end="00:34.765">ん</span><span begin="00:34.765" end="00:34.867">で</span><span begin="00:34.867" end="00:35.017">し</span><span begin="00:35.017" end="00:35.272">ょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">永远没有终点 对吧？</span></p><p begin="00:35.272" end="00:38.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:35.272" end="00:35.533">で</span><span begin="00:35.533" end="00:35.876">意味</span><span begin="00:35.876" end="00:36.130">無</span><span begin="00:36.130" end="00:36.231">い</span><span begin="00:36.231" end="00:36.383">無</span><span begin="00:36.383" end="00:36.537">い</span><span begin="00:36.537" end="00:36.639">無</span><span begin="00:36.639" end="00:36.840">い</span><span begin="00:36.840" end="00:36.941">無</span><span begin="00:36.941" end="00:37.093">い</span><span begin="00:37.093" end="00:37.245">無</span><span begin="00:37.245" end="00:37.347">い</span><span begin="00:37.347" end="00:37.498">ん</span><span begin="00:37.498" end="00:37.599">で</span><span begin="00:37.599" end="00:37.753">し</span><span begin="00:37.753" end="00:38.360">ょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说到底毫无意义 对吧？</span></p><p begin="00:38.777" end="00:40.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:38.777" end="00:39.183">疲</span><span begin="00:39.183" end="00:39.233">れ</span><span begin="00:39.233" end="00:39.385">た？</span><span begin="00:39.385" end="00:39.487">も</span><span begin="00:39.487" end="00:39.587">う</span><span begin="00:39.587" end="00:39.840">い</span><span begin="00:39.840" end="00:39.941">い</span><span begin="00:39.941" end="00:40.043">じ</span><span begin="00:40.043" end="00:40.245">ゃ</span><span begin="00:40.245" end="00:40.347">ん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">累了吗？不如就算了吧</span></p><p begin="00:40.411" end="00:43.046" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:40.411" end="00:40.765">今日</span><span begin="00:40.765" end="00:41.121">は</span><span begin="00:41.121" end="00:42.186">WHITE</span><span begin="00:42.186" end="00:42.336">ガ</span><span begin="00:42.336" end="00:42.641">ー</span><span begin="00:42.641" end="00:43.046">ル</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">今天是纯白的女孩</span></p><p begin="00:43.046" end="00:47.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:43.046" end="00:43.804">夢</span><span begin="00:43.804" end="00:44.159">見</span><span begin="00:44.159" end="00:44.362">て</span><span begin="00:44.362" end="00:47.588">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仍做着梦</span></p><p begin="00:48.659" end="00:51.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:48.659" end="00:48.914">た</span><span begin="00:48.914" end="00:49.216">め</span><span begin="00:49.216" end="00:49.823">息</span><span begin="00:49.823" end="00:50.128">の</span><span begin="00:50.128" end="00:50.532">つ</span><span begin="00:50.532" end="00:50.884">か</span><span begin="00:50.884" end="00:51.137">な</span><span begin="00:51.137" end="00:51.439">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">向往着无需叹息的</span></p><p begin="00:51.439" end="00:53.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:51.439" end="00:51.994">「Good</span> <span begin="00:51.994" end="00:53.210">morning」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">「早安」</span></p><p begin="00:54.634" end="00:57.519" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:54.634" end="00:54.836">疲</span><span begin="00:54.836" end="00:55.038">れ</span><span begin="00:55.038" end="00:55.138">た</span><span begin="00:55.138" end="00:55.491">ら</span><span begin="00:55.491" end="00:55.946">休</spa