pan begin="01:08.065" end="01:08.218">も</span><span begin="01:08.218" end="01:08.318">う、</span><span begin="01:08.318" end="01:08.468">病</span><span begin="01:08.468" end="01:08.673">む</span><span begin="01:08.673" end="01:08.875">の</span><span begin="01:08.875" end="01:09.027">は</span><span begin="01:09.027" end="01:09.229">嫌</span><span begin="01:09.229" end="01:09.536">じ</span><span begin="01:09.536" end="01:09.686">ゃ</span><span begin="01:09.686" end="01:10.041">ん</span><span begin="01:10.041" end="01:10.699">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">真的，已经不想再难受了嘛</span></p><p begin="01:10.699" end="01:14.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:10.699" end="01:10.851">泣</span><span begin="01:10.851" end="01:11.154">い</span><span begin="01:11.154" end="01:11.257">て</span><span begin="01:11.257" end="01:11.460">る</span><span begin="01:11.460" end="01:11.563">顔</span><span begin="01:11.563" end="01:11.866">よ</span><span begin="01:11.866" end="01:12.117">り</span><span begin="01:12.117" end="01:12.425">も</span><span begin="01:12.425" end="01:12.779">笑</span><span begin="01:12.779" end="01:13.334">っ</span><span begin="01:13.334" end="01:13.435">た</span><span begin="01:13.435" end="01:13.638">君</span><span begin="01:13.638" end="01:13.942">が</span><span begin="01:13.942" end="01:14.346">好</span><span begin="01:14.346" end="01:14.751">き</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">比起哭泣的脸 我更喜欢笑着的你</span></p><p begin="01:21.138" end="01:21.847" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:21.138" end="01:21.292">お</span><span begin="01:21.292" end="01:21.392">は</span><span begin="01:21.392" end="01:21.542">よ</span><span begin="01:21.542" end="01:21.847">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">早安</span></p><p begin="01:26.019" end="01:27.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:26.019" end="01:26.121">キ</span><span begin="01:26.121" end="01:26.322">リ</span><span begin="01:26.322" end="01:26.474">が</span><span begin="01:26.474" end="01:26.627">無</span><span begin="01:26.627" end="01:26.778">い</span><span begin="01:26.778" end="01:26.929">か</span><span begin="01:26.929" end="01:27.131">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">正因没有尽头</span></p><p begin="01:28.705" end="01:30.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:28.705" end="01:28.961">意味</span><span begin="01:28.961" end="01:29.163">も</span><span begin="01:29.163" end="01:29.316">無</span><span begin="01:29.316" end="01:29.467">い</span><span begin="01:29.467" end="01:29.720">か</span><span begin="01:29.720" end="01:30.428">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">正因毫无意义</span></p><p begin="01:31.460" end="01:36.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:31.460" end="01:31.659">悩</span><span begin="01:31.659" end="01:31.912">み</span><span begin="01:31.912" end="01:32.217">が</span><span begin="01:32.217" end="01:32.371">続</span><span begin="01:32.371" end="01:32.725">け</span><span begin="01:32.725" end="01:33.028">る</span><span begin="01:33.028" end="01:33.331">の</span><span begin="01:33.331" end="01:33.705">が</span><span begin="01:33.705" end="01:33.959">馬鹿</span><span begin="01:33.959" end="01:34.111">ら</span><span begin="01:34.111" end="01:34.264">し</span><span begin="01:34.264" end="01:34.415">い</span><span begin="01:34.415" end="01:34.670">こ</span><span begin="01:34.670" end="01:34.921">と</span><span begin="01:34.921" end="01:35.176">ぐ</span><span begin="01:35.176" end="01:35.429">ら</span><span begin="01:35.429" end="01:36.141">い</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:36.140" end="01:36.510"><span begin="01:36.140" end="01:36.168">(わ</span><span begin="01:36.168" end="01:36.256">か</span><span begin="01:36.256" end="01:36.358">っ</span><span begin="01:36.358" end="01:36.408">て</span><span begin="01:36.408" end="01:36.510">る)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我其实明白</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">烦恼不断持续这种事有多可笑</span></p><p begin="01:36.510" end="01:38.076" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:36.510" end="01:36.611">こ</span><span begin="01:36.611" end="01:36.762">の</span><span begin="01:36.762" end="01:36.862">先</span><span begin="01:36.862" end="01:37.267">の</span><span begin="01:37.267" end="01:37.822">人生</span><span begin="01:37.822" end="01:37.924">と</span><span begin="01:37.924" end="01:38.076">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">未来的人生啊</span></p><p begin="01:38.076" end="01:39.187" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:38.076" end="01:38.277">何</span><span begin="01:38.277" end="01:38.479">で</span><span begin="01:38.479" end="01:38.681">生</span><span begin="01:38.681" end="01:38.832">き</span><span begin="01:38.832" end="01:38.984">て</span><span begin="01:38.984" end="01:39.085">る</span><span begin="01:39.085" end="01:39.187">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为何而活着啊</span></p><p begin="01:39.187" end="01:41.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:39.187" end="01:39.493">人間</span><span begin="01:39.493" end="01:39.695">の</span><span begin="01:39.695" end="01:40.521">内蔵</span><span begin="01:40.521" end="01:40.725">の</span><span begin="01:40.725" end="01:40.929">仕</span><span begin="01:40.929" end="01:41.083">組</span><span begin="01:41.083" end="01:41.284">み</span><span begin="01:41.284" end="01:41.435">と</span><span begin="01:41.435" end="01:41.840">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">人类内脏的结构啊</span></p><p begin="01:41.840" end="01:44.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:41.840" end="01:41.934">そ</span><span begin="01:41.934" end="01:42.086">う</span><span begin="01:42.086" end="01:42.238">い</span><span begin="01:42.238" end="01:42.440">う</span><span begin="01:42.440" end="01:42.640">の</span><span begin="01:42.640" end="01:42.946">考</span><span begin="01:42.946" end="01:43.097">え</span><span begin="01:43.097" end="01:43.300">込</span><span begin="01:43.300" end="01:43.451">ん</span><span begin="01:43.451" end="01:43.604">じ</span><span begin="01:43.604" end="01:43.856">ゃ</span><span begin="01:43.856" end="01:43.958">う</span><span begin="01:43.958" end="01:44.262">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">总忍不住去想那些事情</span></p><p begin="01:44.262" end="01:47.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:44.262" end="01:45.094">私</span><span begin="01:45.094" end="01:46.205">BLUE</span><span begin="01:46.205" end="01:46.307">ガ</span><span begin="01:46.307" end="01:46.560">ー</span><span begin="01:46.560" end="01:47.117">ル</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我是忧郁的女孩</span></p><p begin="01:47.320" end="01:50.386" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:47.320" end="01:48.008">夢</span><span begin="01:48.008" end="01:48.160">見</span><span begin="01:48.160" end="01:48.311">て</span><span begin="01:48.311" end="01:50.386">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仍做着梦</span></p><p begin="01:52.356" end="01:55.287" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:52.356" end="01:52.661">た</span><span begin="01:52.661" end="01:53.016">め</span><span begin="01:53.016" end="01:53.722">息</span><span begin="01:53.722" end="01:53.975">の</span><span begin="01:53.975" end="01:54.329">つ</span><span begin="01:54.329" end="01:54.683">か</span><span begin="01:54.683" end="01:55.036">な</span><span begin="01:55.036" end="01:55.287">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">向往着无需叹息的</span></p><p begin="01:55.287" end="01:57.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:55.287" end="01:55.694">「お</span><span begin="01:55.694" end="01:56.198">や</span><span begin="01:56.198" end="01:56.656">す</span><span begin="01:56.656" end="01:57.668">み」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">「晚安」</span></p><p begin="01:58.540" end="02:01.981" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:58.540" end="01:58.947">疲</span><span begin="01:58.947" end="01:59.049">れ</span><span begin="01:59.049" end="01:59.201">た</span><span begin="01:59.201" end="01:59.352">ら</span><span begin="01:59.352" end="02:00.213">休</span><span begin="02:00.213" end="02:00.464">ん</span><span begin="02:00.464" end="02:00.869">じ</span><span begin="02:00.869" end="02:00.970">ゃ</span><span begin="02:00.970" end="02:01.324">う</span><span begin="02:01.324" end="02:01.981">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">累了的话就停下吧</span></p><p begin="02:04.024" end="02:09.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:04.024" end="02:04.177">ご</span><span begin="02:04.177" end="02:04.327">飯</span><span begin="02:04.327" end="02:04.478">も</span><span begin="02:04.478" end="02:04.782">食</span><span begin="02:04.782" end="02:05.034">べ</span><span begin="02:05.034" end="02:05.136">な</span><span begin="02:05.136" end="02:05.287">き</span><span begin="02:05.287" end="02:05.540">ゃ</span><span begin="02:05.540" end="02:05.692">な</span><span begin="02:05.692" end="02:05.843">の</span><span begin="02:05.843" end="02:06.046">に</span><span begin="02:06.046" end="02:06.704">喉</span><span begin="02:06.704" end="02:07.615">を</span><span begin="02:07.615" end="02:08.374">通</span><span begin="02:08.374" end="02:08.729">ら</span><span begin="02:08.729" end="02:08.984">な</span><span begin="02:08.984" end="02:09.337">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">饭也不能不吃 却咽不下去</span></p><p begin="02:09.363" end="02:11.781" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:09.363" end="02:09.504">笑</span><span begin="02:09.504" end="02:09.756">っ</span><span begin="02:09.756" end="02:10.009">て</span><span begin="02:10.009" end="02:10.263">い</span><span begin="02:10.263" end="02:10.515">た</span><span begin="02:10.515" end="02:10.767">い</span><span begin="02:10.767" end="02:11.073">の</span><span begin="02:11.073" end="02:11.428">に</span><span begin="02:11.428" end="02:11.781">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">明明还是想笑的啊</span></p><p begin="02:12.087" end="02:14.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:12.087" end="02:12.240">も</span><span begin="02:12.240" end="02:12.493">う、</span><span begin="02:12.493" end="02:12.798">病</span><span begin="02:12.798" end="02:12.950">む</span><span begin="02:12.950" end="02:13.102">の</span><span begin="02:13.102" end="02:13.254">は</span><span begin="02:13.254" end="02:13.406">嫌</span><span begin="02:13.406" end="02:13.608">じ</span><span begin="02:13.608" end="02:13.812">ゃ</span><span begin="02:13.812" end="02:14.167">ん</span><span begin="02:14.167" end="02:14.726">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">真的，已经不想再难受了</span></p><p begin="02:14.730" end="02:19.804" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:14.730" end="02:14.846">泣</span><span begin="02:14.846" end="02:15.047">い</span><span begin="02:15.047" end="02:15.400">て</span><span begin="02:15.400" end="02:15.652">る</span><span begin="02:15.652" end="02:15.804">顔</span><span begin="02:15.804" end="02:16.007">よ</span><span begin="02:16.007" end="02:16.161">り</span><span begin="02:16.161" end="02:16.465">も</span><span begin="02:16.465" end="02:16.768">笑</span><span begin="02:16.768" end="02:17.021">っ</span><span begin="02:17.021" end="02:17.274">た</span><span begin="02:17.274" end="02:18.131">私</span><span begin="02:18.131" end="02:18.384">が</span><span begin="02:18.384" end="02:18.486">好</span><span begin="02:18.486" end="02:18.638">き</span><span begin="02:18.638" end="02:19.095">な</span><span begin="02:19.095" end="02:19.451">の</span><span begin="02:19.451" end="02:19.804">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">比起哭泣的脸 我更喜欢笑着的自己才对啊</span></p></div></body></tt>